<title>USA: Telco Systems wins 3-year NYNEX contract.</title>
<headline>Telco Systems wins 3-year NYNEX contract.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telco Systems Inc said Monday it signed a three-year contract valued at between $40 million and $50 million to provide NYNEX Corp with transmission products.</p>
<p>Telco Systems provides technology that allows organizations to transmit voice, data, video and image traffic over public and private networks. The company posted sales of $86.5 million through the first nine months of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
